  "facts": [
    "The Kerenzerberg Tunnel stretches 5,760 metres, making it one of Switzerland's longest motorway tunnels and a critical spine on the A3 motorway linking Basel and Zürich to Sargans.",
    "Designed as a one‑way passage, the tunnel carries traffic from Zürich to Sargans while the opposite direction hugs Walensee’s shoreline through six former railway tunnels.",
    "Dangerous goods are strictly prohibited in the Kerenzerberg Tunnel, a safety rule that underscores the tunnel’s stringent traffic regulations and engineering safeguards."
